# Keep the build context small and reproducible.
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
backend/storage
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
.git
.github
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
# Never bake local secrets into an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.md
